# File Roller (GTK 4): notifications and its own names. No portals at all (GTK 4 keeps its own dialog
# when it can't see them): it extracts next to the archive and adds whole folders, which the document
# portal (one file per pick) can't give it.
include notify
own org.gnome.FileRoller
own org.gnome.FileRoller.*
own org.gnome.ArchiveManager1
